/*
 * Root dispatcher for validating binary operators in Ymir.
 *
 * This module does not perform validation itself. Instead, it:
 *   - normalizes the operator(e.g., += → +)
 *   - determines the operator’s semantic category(math, bitwise, logical…)
 *   - dispatches to the appropriate specialized validator
 *
 * This module is the central entry point for all binary operator validation in
 * the semantic pipeline.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::value::operator::binary
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/value/operator/binary.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created(YYYY-MM-DD): 2026-03-28
 * @Copyright(C) 2021–2026 GNU-Ymir
 * @License
 *   ```text
